Fame into Funds, Jake Enters Politics? &amp; Venture Bubble Signs DPI/IRR sixth man NIL\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-allin-同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化-这就是泡沫信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d5eab23b851d465-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化，这就是泡沫信号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">后轮买家愿为同一家公司多付两三倍溢价、公司基本面却毫无变化——The Chainsmokers 的 Drew Taggart 说，这正是当下该留意的泡沫市场行为信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">名人投资人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, a Year in Stealth and $20M to Replace Slack | Sara Du, Ando MCP thinking traces nerd sniping PMF RFC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-solofounders-单人创始人没想清楚要做什么-先融了2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88fe752a22f867ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人没想清楚要做什么，先融了2000万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她认为 Slack 是为人类建的十五年前的写字楼，根本装不下智能体这种新住户，于是以单人创始人身份，在还没想清楚具体打法时就融了两轮共2000万美元去重建一个消息平台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Fry Quaker / Society of Friends Newgate Prison minister(Quaker title) Jails Act 1823\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-stuffmissed-被讥讽为-监狱游客-的贵格会主妇-推动了英国首部监狱法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>被讥讽为「监狱游客」的贵格会主妇，推动了英国首部监狱法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">议员们攻击她没有法律背景，说她只是监狱里的「游客」,但正是她走访欧洲各地写下的报告和游说，促成了1823年监狱法案的通过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监狱改革</span><span class=\"tag\">贵格会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At the Money: The Data Behind America&#x27;s Wealthy pass-through business centimillionaire ExecuComp non-compete\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-mastersinbiz-福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3-却拿走一半财富报道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf120ae12f936e3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">13:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3%,却拿走一半财富报道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正撑起美国财富版图的，是150万名身价2500万美元以上、从不上福布斯400的私营企业主，而非聚光灯下的400个人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">遗产税</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Spain, Europe, and the Future of Work flexicurity cupo strong bundle / weak bundle Jevons effect second mover strategy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-tyler-ai真正威胁的不是新工作-而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9fc6f5cb42ffd4f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正威胁的不是新工作，而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">边界清晰、可验证、单一任务的工作早已被外包到印度，现在轮到AI接手；真正能抵抗AI的，是需要人际关系与政治斡旋的凌乱工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">西班牙政治经济</span><span class=\"tag\">欧盟一体化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $1 Trillion AI Buildout | State of Markets Jevons paradox J-curve ACV GMV smiling retention curve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-a16z-云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元-但ai真实采用率仅2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元，但AI真实采用率仅2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">标普500公司AI部署率已达69%,但用长期跟踪指标衡量的实际影响仅为2%,说明这轮万亿美元级扩张才刚刚开始，远未到收获期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI采用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silification Geology (OPALS) with Patrice Rey potch opal opaline silica hydrophane native title doublet/triplet opal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-ologies-破解蛋白石成因用了十年-关键线索来自火星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>破解蛋白石成因用了十年，关键线索来自火星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中央澳大利亚的古内海从未沉积石灰岩，酸性风化把火山岩变成硅胶——这套机制先在火星的蛋白石矿物里被验证，才反推出欧泊成因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地质学</span><span class=\"tag\">宝石学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does the UK really have nine out of the ten poorest regions in Northern Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) GDP per head household disposable income telomere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-moreorless-英国-十大最穷地区占九席-换个收入指标就只剩两席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>英国「十大最穷地区占九席」换个收入指标就只剩两席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用人均GDP衡量，英国确实占了北欧十大最穷地区的九席；换成家庭可支配收入这个更贴近生活水平的指标，这个数字立刻掉到两席。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">统计口径</span><span class=\"tag\">地区差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500b Melissa Lane on Herotodus and Thucydides historia autopsy nomos-physis debate rhetoric of anti-rhetoric Constitution of the Five Thousand\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-hopwag-那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话-被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话，被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修昔底德让雅典人对米洛斯人说：正义只在实力相当的双方之间才谈得上，弱者的筹码只剩「希望」；一群美国社区组织者读到这段，觉得雅典人说得在理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希腊史学</span><span class=\"tag\">修昔底德</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E254｜超级厄尔尼诺来了，我们的日常所需真会因它涨价吗？ ONI IOD ENSO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-sv101-厄尔尼诺不是全球涨价按钮-真正决定价格的是产区集中度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>厄尔尼诺不是全球涨价按钮：真正决定价格的是产区集中度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同样遭遇干旱，集中在两三个国家的棕榈油、大豆价格应声大涨，产区分散的水稻、小麦却几乎无感——厄尔尼诺伤不伤得到你的钱包，取决于贸易集中度而非气候本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span><span class=\"tag\">厄尔尼诺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Golden Goose Awards 2026: The Science Behind the Winners (Part 1) (EP 59) Histotripsy Cavitation Duty cycle Jamming Black Marble algorithm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-fromfirstprinc-把肿瘤震碎而非烧掉-免疫系统才能认出残骸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>把肿瘤震碎而非烧掉，免疫系统才能认出残骸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">声波把肿瘤震碎而非烧化，细胞碎片留住肿瘤抗原，让免疫系统学会识别并抑制身体其他部位的转移灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗器械</span><span class=\"tag\">精准医学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Will AI take power — or will humans use it to take power first? With Katja Grace and Tom Davidson model spec warning shot intent alignment hedonium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-eightythousand-人类独裁者掌权-结果可能比失控ai更糟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8483b66a7194429e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>人类独裁者掌权，结果可能比失控AI更糟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汤姆认为单个人类掌握绝对权力后，大概率会像历史上的暴君一样把某种狭隘价值锁定为终局，而受过伦理训练的AI在对齐的情况下反而更可能保持开放和反思。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frank Furedi on the Case for Populism paradox of tolerance anti-pluralism spirit of populism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-goodfight-反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍异见的人-民粹主义辩护者说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍异见的人——民粹主义辩护者说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的论据是：欧尔班执政十六年零封禁政党、零驱散示威；反倒是布鲁塞尔一场讨论「保守派女性主义」的学术会议，被 Antifa 逼到要出动水炮才能开完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民粹主义</span><span class=\"tag\">民主理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Personal Agent Race Is Here | Anish Acharya &amp; David Pawlan narrow startups presumptuousness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-a16z-个人智能体真正的护城河不是人设-是敢替用户做主/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>个人智能体真正的护城河不是人设，是敢替用户做主</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人格设定几句话就能改，谈不上壁垒；真正难复制的是主动性——智能体敢在多大程度上不经请示就替用户把事办了，这条线一旦越界会瞬间失去用户信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">消费级AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bill Ackman: The Biggest Fight of His Life AVM (arterial venous malformation) MPC (master planned community) float\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-knowledge-医生通常脑压迫超5小时就放弃手术-她被压了19小时才做手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fce4e1a559b6e3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>医生通常脑压迫超5小时就放弃手术，她被压了19小时才做手术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿克曼说医生通常在脑内出血压迫超过5小时后判定脑死亡而放弃手术，女儿被压迫19小时，他仍要求医生尽全力手术，如今她认知和幽默感基本恢复，语言、视力与行走仍在艰难恢复中。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投资哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI颠覆风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The neuroscience of resonance: How to use language to strengthen attachment with your child with Sarah Peyton resonance earned secure attachment vagus nerve alarmed aloneness Panksepp&#x27;s core emotion circuits nonviolent communication (NVC)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-secureattach-共情可以沉默-共鸣却必须开口确认/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">59:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>共情可以沉默，共鸣却必须开口确认</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">共情是你独自对孩子产生的感受，可以完全不说话；共鸣却必须靠语气和猜测反复确认「我懂你吗」，孩子说「不对」时，两个人才算真正对上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">非暴力沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 223 ALS: Unraveling the mystery TDP-43 C9ORF72 penetrance bulbar onset / spinal onset upper motor neuron / lower motor neuron ALS Untangled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-tpwky-冰桶挑战筹了2-2亿美元-als依然没有能治愈的药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>冰桶挑战筹了2.2亿美元，ALS依然没有能治愈的药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年那场冰桶挑战让近3000万人捐款2.2亿美元，但十多年后，唯一被广泛批准的药物利鲁唑也只能把生存期平均延长三个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ALS</span><span class=\"tag\">渐冻症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"291: How Your Kid’s Exclusion Hurts You Too | Michelle Icard free-floating atom bellying up to the buffet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-asklisa-孩子被朋友圈排挤-家长插手撮合反而把路堵死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42f1705a647f9db2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友圈排挤，家长插手撮合反而把路堵死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当孩子被朋友圈排除在外时，家长想替她说和、找对方家长理论往往帮倒忙，更该做的是把自己的愤怒放到安全的地方，再问孩子想怎样应对。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期教育</span><span class=\"tag\">社交排挤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Does This Stuff Actually Work? Parents Write Back primary attachment figure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-unruffled-崩溃时不必哄不必转移注意力-说出那种难反而管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">23:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>崩溃时不必哄不必转移注意力，说出那种难反而管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位妈妈按同一条反直觉建议——把接送时的失落、过渡期的失控感直接说出来，而不是哄、转移注意力或安抚——试了几周后，孩子撞门撕咬式的崩溃和拔头发的自我安抚都明显减少了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">分离焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪引导</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Obsolete or Irreplaceable? Garrison Lovely on Stopping the Race to Replace Human Labor enshittification RLHF RSI RLVR fast follow citizens&#x27; assemblies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-cogrev-美国放缓ai竞速-拖慢的是中国而非把优势让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/10c1e8c45bb33c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>美国放缓AI竞速，拖慢的是中国而非把优势让出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国AI战略是「快速跟随」，落后美国前沿3到9个月；美国主动减速会让整条赛道变慢，而不是把领先地位拱手让给追随者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Stop Trying to Make Your Kid Feel Good About Themselves\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-goodinside-自信不是感觉良好-而是难受时依然信任自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">19:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>自信不是感觉良好，而是难受时依然信任自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母急着修复孩子的难受、摆平结果、用外部认可安抚内心，这些出于爱的反射动作，恰恰在缩小孩子能安然做自己的范围。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Economy is Broken | Logan Wright LGFV shadow banking K-shaped economy involution 3-6-3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-chinatalk-中国经济不是崩溃-而是主动选择了慢性衰败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbfe84346ee6490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>中国经济不是崩溃，而是主动选择了慢性衰败</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者认为通向危机的从来不是外部冲击，而是改革本身——所以北京宁可用增长换稳定，把一次金融危机拖成了看不到头的慢性衰败。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">房地产</span>\n</div></div></a>"]